SECTION 40: UNIVERSAL DIGITAL SETTLEMENT & POINT PLAY ECOSYSTEM GOVERNANCE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. UNIVERSAL ECOSYSTEM CURRENCY & APPLICABILITY:
The "Point Play" infrastructure, engineered and operated exclusively by RudraX
Technologies Studio, serves as the singular, mandatory, and universal digital point
settlement protocol across all existing, pending, and future software, APIs, web
applications, SDKs, and platforms released under the RudraX brand. Any commercial
or premium tier across the ecosystem shall derive its access rights exclusively
from Point Play point balances and forged access tokens.

2. ON-CHAIN DEPOSIT PROTOCOL & CRYPTOGRAPHIC VERIFICATION:
All inbound balance top-ups must execute strictly through verified Solana-based
vault settlements utilizing authorized digital assets (USDC and SOL). Conversion
of on-chain value to platform points requires:
  a. Valid cryptographic transaction hash (TxID/Signature) submission.
  b. Automated Remote Procedure Call (RPC) network audit verifying block confirmation,
     exact asset denomination, and target vault destination.
  c. Final cryptographic or administrative sign-off before point ledger allocation.

3. FORGED SDK ACCESS TOKENS & CONSUMABILITY:
Users and enterprise licensees may burn accredited point balances to forge
single-use, cryptographically generated SDK Redeem Tokens. These tokens are
interoperable across any integration powered by the RudraX Universal SDK. All
points committed to token generation, plan subscriptions, or API queries are
strictly consumable once processed.

4. STRICT IRREVERSIBILITY & NON-REFUNDABLE ASSET POLICY:
Due to the immutable nature of public distributed ledger networks, all on-chain
deposits and subsequent point conversions are strictly NON-REFUNDABLE and FINAL.
RudraX Technologies Studio bears zero liability for user-side wallet dispatch
errors, unsupported network transfers, lost private keys, or fraudulent deposit
submissions. Any attempt to submit fabricated transaction signatures or exploit
RPC mechanisms shall result in immediate, permanent forfeiture of points and
total account termination.

5. SPAM DEFENSE, COOLDOWN MATRIX & ASSET CONSERVATION:
The ecosystem enforces a mandatory 24-hour settlement submission cooldown per
authenticated identity to prevent network congestion and automated exploitation.
In the event that an SDK token contains point values exceeding the target tier's
cost, the excess value shall automatically route back to the verified user ledger
or generate an ancillary credit token in accordance with ecosystem balancing logic.

